# Nginx Proxy Manager - Hardened Install Notes

## Admin access
Port 81 is bound to localhost only. From your local machine:

    ssh -p {{ npm_ssh_port }} -N -L 8181:127.0.0.1:81 {{ npm_admin_user }}@{{ ansible_host }}

Open http://127.0.0.1:8181.

Default login: admin@example.com / changeme

Change the default password immediately.

## Useful commands

    cd {{ npm_dir }}
    docker compose ps
    docker compose logs -f
    docker inspect --format='{% raw %}{{.State.Health.Status}}{% endraw %}' nginx-proxy-manager
